teleport not levitation.  But that most certainly does give you a
way back.  Playng a Valk I've used that level teleport to build a
gigantic stash at a shallow level because I could descend picking
up stuff and carry far past burdened just before going back up.
Be strained, poof back up to stash, drop down to burdened,
shuffle a bit on-level to the stash, descned on foot, lather
rinse repeat.



